# rcrwhyg project rules

- Never commit secrets or hard-code API keys/app secrets in source.
- Server-only dependencies must be `optional` and enabled only via the `ssr` feature.
- Prefer CSS variables from `style/tokens.css` over hard-coded brand colors in Rust views.
- Visual direction is **calm-tech** with a **dynamic mouse-follow backdrop** (ADR-004).
- Themes: **dark and light only**. Do not reintroduce Terminal / dual-shell style modes (ADR-003 / superseded ADR-010).
- Keep a single Leptos route tree and a single site chrome.
- Site is diversified: new areas beyond blog/tools are allowed; register routes + header nav.
- Content source of truth for essays is site-owned `posts`, not multi-platform `articles`.
- Prefer Leptos ecosystem crates (thaw, leptos-use, …) and Suspense/Transition for async UI; design toward islands.
- Axum serves HTTP, and will serve WebSocket + SSE in-process — do not split realtime into another service by default.
- Production server artifact is static **musl** via **cargo-zigbuild**; prefer musl-friendly deps (`rustls`).
- Follow ADRs in `docs/adr/` for stack, areas, ecosystem, realtime, build, and publishing changes.
- Testing: follow [docs/testing.md](../../docs/testing.md). Prefer adding unit/DB tests with new server/domain logic; never commit secrets.
- Quality gates are mandatory: `hooks/pre-commit` + `hooks/pre-push` (fmt / clippy `-D warnings` / tests / wasm check / article lint); local full pass = `./tools/test-local.sh`; remote CI must be green after push. See [docs/quality-gates.md](../../docs/quality-gates.md).
- AI collaboration contract: [AGENT.md](../../AGENT.md). Stay within this repo; ask before any out-of-repo or outward-facing action.
- Articles live in `articles/` as the **personal-website canonical**; WeChat【如春日午后阳光】 is a secondary repost channel managed by the user (not the AI). Workflow: [rules/content-quality.md](../../rules/content-quality.md), template [specs/article-template.md](../../specs/article-template.md).
